Bind Npc 29014 Zone 71 for karus
Bind Npc 29027 Zone 71 for elmorad
Quest 731 "[Lemegeton] To the Bottom of the Abyss"
    Journal for karus "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Bros."
    Journal for elmorad "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Sais."
    Collect 1 of 900249000
    Collect 1 of 900250000

Requires (player level >= 72 and player is karus and quest 729 is completed) or (player level >= 72 and player is elmorad and quest 730 is completed)

Rewards
    Give 250000 experience
    Give 30000 coins

On available
    Say "Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] seems to be strangely nervous. Do you know anything about it?"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "You are here. Your last work was great."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Please give me the seal Scroll that you will seal in your body, then, <selfname>.\n\nWe must give Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [31Devil] Foras and [55Devil] Orobas."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You are here. Your last work was great."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Please give me the seal Scroll that you will seal in your body, then, <selfname>.\n\nWe must give Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [31Devil] Foras and [55Devil] Orobas."

On in_progress
    Say "Where is the seal Scroll?"

On claimable
    Show quest "Thank you. With this seal Scroll, the soul of devil will be locked in this ring."

On completed
    Say "Now it's time to get the Duke of Silver Armor out of the deep abyss. It shouldn't be that hard to find him because [19Devil] Sallos is always dressed in his glittering armor. And with him are [43Devil] Savnock and [64Devil] Haures. Seal them up as well."
